<title>NETHERLANDS: GTI 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 30 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>GTI 1996 NET PROFIT RISES 30 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    14.65 vs  11.43</p>
<p>    Net profit			    25.6  vs  19.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  7.36 vs   5.72</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.58 vs   1.39</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    59.4  vs  38.5</p>
<p>    Interest gains			 6.2  vs   8.6</p>
<p>    Tax				     17.9  vs   7.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical engineering firm GTI Holding NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected profits to rise in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
